        {
          "text": " Nao wakasimama mbele ya Musa, na mbele ya Eleazari kuhani, na mbele ya wakuu, na mkutano wote, mlangoni pa hema ya kukutania, wakasema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baba yetu alikufa nyikani, naye hakuwamo katika mkutano wa hao waliojikutanisha kinyume cha BWANA katika mkutano wa Kora; lakini akafa katika dhambi zake mwenyewe; naye alikuwa hana wana wa kiume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa nini basi jina la baba yetu kufutwa katika jamaa zake kwa sababu alikuwa hana mwana wa kiume? Tupe sisi urithi pamoja na ndugu zake baba yetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
